# Protected gate paths (ENG-140, G-B3/G-B4). Changes here are control changes and
# need Rolando's explicit review. Takes effect when the ruleset turns on
# code-owner review (ENG-142); until then scripts/control-change.mjs flags them.
#
# `*` makes Rolando the code owner of every file (ENG-142), so with code-owner review
# on, only his approval can satisfy the main ruleset. Another write collaborator (the
# factory bot) approving a PR never counts. The specific lines below keep the record
# of which paths are control paths.
